This repository is a production-oriented continuation of the original private
"TSMixer-and-iTransformer" project by MostafaK66. Its ETTm1/ETTm2 experiments,
NeuralForecast model comparison, evaluation, and plotting formed the baseline.

The original repository did not contain a license file. The owner has added the
MIT License to this maintained version. NeuralForecast, datasetsforecast, TSMixer,
iTransformer, benchmark datasets, and other dependencies retain their respective
licenses and are not bundled with this repository.
